T*
(and smashed the statue of the dictator Enver Hoxha\054 the barrier of fear was) Tj
T*
-0.032173 Tw
(completely broken among the Albanian people\054 and this was followed by rapid) Tj
T*
0 Tw
(steps to lift the total ban on religion\072) Tj
T*
