(\052 Opening the historic mosques\072 In that same period\054 thousands of Albanian) Tj
T*
(Muslims poured in to open the mosques that had earlier been turned into) Tj
T*
(warehouses\054 museums and sports grounds\056 One of the most famous is the) Tj
T*
(Et\047hem Bey Mosque in the heart of the capital Tirana\054 where more than) Tj
T*
(10\054000 Muslims gathered around it in an awe\055inspiring scene to raise the) Tj
T*
(adhan again and hold the prayer in public for the first time in decades\056) Tj
