(\052 Officially abolishing the communist laws\072 The then tottering communist) Tj
T*
(government was forced to strike out all the previous laws and constitutional) Tj
T*
(articles that punished with prison and hard labour the mere possession of a) Tj
T*
(Mushaf or a religious book\054 and a new constitution was issued guaranteeing) Tj
T*
(full religious freedom\056) Tj
